# Netlify redirects. First match wins. The forced 404s make sure nothing that is not a page
# is ever served from the deploy, even if a file slips into out/.
/*.md        /404/   404!
/*.mjs       /404/   404!
/*.py        /404/   404!
/.env*       /404/   404!
/.git/*      /404/   404!
/content/*   /404/   404!
